{"title":"Gifted websites","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>This is a collection of <b>websites for gifted and talented students</b>.\n</p><p>The <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a> website hosting this <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPSWiki\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPSWiki\">AoPSWiki</a> is devoted to avid students of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics\" title=\"Mathematics\">mathematics</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Problem_solving\" title=\"Problem solving\">problem solving</a> as well as many resources for gifted students.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Organizations_for_Gifted_Students\">Organizations for Gifted Students</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_websites&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Organizations for Gifted Students\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talented_Youth\" title=\"Center for Talented Youth\">Center for Talented Youth</a> (CTY) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Johns_Hopkins_University\" title=\"Johns Hopkins University\">Johns Hopkins University</a>.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://cty.jhu.edu/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Davidson_Institute&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1\" class=\"new\" title=\"Davidson Institute (page does not exist)\">Davidson Institute</a> is dedicated to helping young scholars develop their talents.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ditd.org/\">website</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=EPGY\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"EPGY\">EPGY</a> hosts an assortment of gifted programs.  <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://epgy.stanford.edu/\">Homepage</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Center_for_Talent_Development\" title=\"Center for Talent Development\">Center for Talent Development</a> (CTD) at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Northwestern_University\" title=\"Northwestern University\">Northwestern University</a>. <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.ctd.northwestern.edu/\">Homepage</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"General_Gifted_Sites\">General Gifted Sites</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_websites&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: General Gifted Sites\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://gtworld.org/?\">GT World</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.hoagiesgifted.org/\">Hoagies Gifted</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.nagc.org/\">National Association for Gifted Children</a> (NAGC)</li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.gifted.uconn.edu/nrcgt.html\">National Research Center on the Gifted and Talented</a></li></ul>\n<p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_websites&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_education\" title=\"Gifted education\">Gifted education</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Gifted_programs\" title=\"Gifted programs\">Gifted programs</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_summer_programs\" title=\"Academic summer programs\">Academic summer programs</a></li></ul>\n<!-